   "text": "born with:\n  env    = snapshot_s  (own microVM -- siblings\n           cannot contaminate each other)\n  memory = parent conversation UP TO step s\n           (fork=True: it remembers steps 1..s)\n  + one NEW user message: verdict + ITS hint\n    (opens with git diff to ground in the disk)\njournal: starts EMPTY -- its own steps only",
